# The solutions collection ships EMPTY.
#
# A money page is the one page type nobody can write for you: it states what
# this company sells, what it costs and what the buyer gets. A template that
# shipped an example would ship a claim, and AGENTS rule 1 does not allow one.
#
# To add the first: /write-content picks the target from
# marketing/keyword-map.md § High-intent, .vscode/frontmatter.code-snippets has
# the `solution` snippet, and the schema in src/content.config.ts names every
# required field. The route (src/pages/solutions/[...slug].astro) is already
# here — getStaticPaths over an empty collection builds nothing.
